  "description": "That's the nature of fate. You never know where it will lead. But it will inevitably reach someone. Just as the wind can only disperse and never be stopped, the path taken by those born with a legendary destiny is unstoppable. Here lies Yongcheonsan, a mountain where legends and those who pursue them become legends themselves.\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
